      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hello there!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My name is Ole Brolin and this is my little website.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I make, record and produce music, build electronic music instruments and art installations. For money I mostly work as
a sound- or art technician.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have always loved taking things apart and doing this I learned how to repair
stuff. Electronics, mostly audio- &amp;amp; music gear but a power supply is a power
supply is a power supply.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
